    "ironwrap-bus-mcp": "Bus readiness and operating truth plus envelope-scoped, approved dead-letter recovery.",
    "erpnext-roofing-mcp": "IronWrap OS Frappe operating core: read, deterministic policy checks, and review-gated approved writes (legacy server name retained for compatibility).",
